# Personal, git-ignored list of Sovereign plugin repos to clone for local
# development against sovereign/ (see docs/plugin-development.md in that
# repo for the ".local" plugin convention).
#
# Copy this file to sovereign.plugins.local (no .example suffix) and edit
# it — that file is gitignored, never committed. Run `./workbench.sh
# plugins pull` to clone every listed repo into sovereign/plugins/<name>.local.
#
# Format, one entry per line:
#   <git-url>          → cloned to sovereign/plugins/<repo-name>.local
#   <name> <git-url>   → cloned to sovereign/plugins/<name>.local
# Blank lines and "#" comments (whole-line or trailing) are ignored.

# Plugins I'm actively developing
git@github.com:sovereignfs/sovereign-tasks.git
notes git@github.com:me/plugin-notes.git
